---
import { MapPin, MessageCircle, Phone } from 'lucide-astro';
import { config } from '../config';
---

<section id="inicio" class="relative pt-32 md:pt-44 pb-24 px-6 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-gray-900 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute -top-4 -right-4 w-24 h-24 bg-blue-200 dark:bg-blue-800/30 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-60"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 -left-12 w-32 h-32 bg-blue-300 dark:bg-blue-700/30 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-40"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-48 h-48 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-30"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-14 items-center">
      <div>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/40 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 text-sm font-medium mb-6">
          <MapPin class="w-4 h-4" />
          Plantilla base para profesionales
        </span>

        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
          Una web profesional lista para adaptarse a
          <span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400"> doctores, abogados, psicólogos y consultores</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-8 max-w-2xl">
          Esta plantilla madre está pensada para mostrar autoridad, explicar servicios, generar confianza y facilitar el contacto sin empezar cada proyecto desde cero.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mb-10">
          <a href="#contacto" class="px-6 py-3 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-600 transition-all duration-200 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium">
            <MessageCircle class="w-5 h-5" />
            Solicitar información
          </a>
          <a href="#servicios" class="px-6 py-3 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 hover:border-blue-300 dark:hover:border-blue-700 transition-all duration-200 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium">
            <Phone class="w-5 h-5" />
            Ver estructura de servicios
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-900/40">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">1 base</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">para varios nichos</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-900/40">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">9 bloques</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">comerciales reutilizables</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-900/40">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">100%</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">adaptable al profesional</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-900/40 shadow-xl">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <div>
              <div class="text-sm text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-medium">{config.app.name}</div>
              <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Plantilla madre profesional</div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">KM</div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 p-4">Hero con propuesta de valor y CTA</div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 p-4">Bloque de problemas o cuándo consultar</div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 p-4">Servicios, proceso y perfil profesional</div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 p-4">Testimonios, FAQ y contacto</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
